# Block internal dev/planning files from being served publicly.
# Trailing "!" forces the rule to shadow an existing static file
# (Netlify serves files before redirects otherwise). Added 2026-07-18.
# llms.txt and domain-verification .txt files stay public.
/CLAUDE.md   /404.html   404!
/AGENTS.md   /404.html   404!
/README.md   /404.html   404!
/docs/*      /404.html   404!
/tasks/*     /404.html   404!
/scripts/*   /404.html   404!
/.claude/*   /404.html   404!
